OL,3,GNEWSATeacher sexually abused four boys,
OL,4,Acourt hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former boarding school teacher
OL,7,Fsexually abused four boys, a court has
OL,8,Fbeen told.
OL,10,FDerek Barker, 92, denies three charges
OL,11,Fof buggery, three charges of indecency
OL,12,Fwith a child and two charges of
OL,13,Findecent assault at Monkton Combe
OL,14,FSchool in Bath when he taught there in
OL,15,Fthe 1970s and 1980s.
OL,17,FBristol Crown Court heard that one of
OL,18,Fthe boys confided in the school's
OL,19,Fchaplain about the alleged abuse and
OL,20,Fwas told it was a "wicked lie" and that
OL,21,F"God would punish him one day".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
