OL,3,GNEWSATeacher sexually abused four boys,
OL,4,Acourt hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarker resigned from the school in the
OL,7,F1980s after another student took a
OL,8,Fphotograph of him tied to his bed at
OL,9,Fhis home in the nearby village of
OL,10,FLimpley Stoke, in Wiltshire.
